---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---
<section class="section shell" id="initiatives">
    <div class="sec-head" data-rv>
      <p class="badge">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="100" d="M3.5 19C5.8 11.5 8.8 8.5 12 8.5S18.2 11.5 20.5 19"/><path pathLength="100" d="M7 19c1.6-4.6 3.2-6.4 5-6.4s3.4 1.8 5 6.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="3.8" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
        OUR INITIATIVES
      </p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Three Programs,<br>Run in the Open.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="init-layout">
      <div class="init-cards">
        <article class="init-card" data-rv>
          <div class="img-wrap">
            <Image src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1437622368342-7a3d73a34c8f?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A sea turtle swimming over a reef" width={600} height={500} widths={[320, 520, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 900px) 50vw, 260px" loading="lazy" format="webp" quality={50} />
            <span class="tag">Demak Coast</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Mangrove Lines at Demak</h3>
          <p>Since 2023 we have planted Rhizophora along 14 km of eroding coastline, together with the fishpond farmers who work it. Where the rows hold, crabs and young fish come back first.</p>
          <a class="learn" href="#involved">Read the coast log <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="init-card" data-rv style="--d:.09s">
          <div class="img-wrap">
            <Image src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502082553048-f009c37129b9?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Rows of young trees in a restored forest" width={600} height={500} widths={[320, 520, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 900px) 50vw, 260px" loading="lazy" format="webp" quality={50} />
            <span class="tag">Kubu Raya</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Canal Blocks and Jelutung</h3>
          <p>Twenty drainage canals cut across the peat dome we work on. Fourteen are dammed; the six that remain are on the 2026 work plan, each block built and maintained by crews from the nearest village.</p>
          <a class="learn" href="#involved">See the canal plan <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="init-card" data-rv style="--d:.18s">
          <div class="img-wrap">
            <Image src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593113598332-cd288d649433?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Volunteers working together packing supplies" width={600} height={500} widths={[320, 520, 700]} sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 900px) 50vw, 260px" loading="lazy" format="webp" quality={50} />
            <span class="tag">64 Villages</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Patrols Paid by the Village Fund</h3>
          <p>Rangers log every route in a book kept at the village office, open to anyone. Snares, new clearings, and hornbill sightings are read aloud at the monthly meeting, then printed in Field Notes.</p>
          <a class="learn" href="#involved">How patrols report <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <aside class="how-rail" data-rv style="--d:.1s">
        <h3>How We Work</h3>
        <p class="rail-sub">Every site, from peat dome to coastline, runs through the same four steps before a single seedling is ordered.</p>
        <div class="step" data-rv>
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <div><h4>Walk the land first</h4><p>Two weeks of walking boundaries with village elders and the patrol: water, grazing routes, old burn scars. Nothing is planted from a map alone.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-rv style="--d:.07s">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <div><h4>Sign, then plant</h4><p>Work starts only after a written agreement with the village: who is paid, what gets planted, and who owns the harvest if the trees bear fruit.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-rv style="--d:.14s">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <div><h4>Tend for five years</h4><p>Crews water, guard, and replace dead stock for five years. Most seedlings die in the second year, not the first, so the contract runs long.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step" data-rv style="--d:.21s">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <div><h4>Publish the count</h4><p>Survival is counted per site every six months and printed in Field Notes. A site that fails is reported as failed, with the reason next to the number.</p></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
